Subject: [PATCH] fix(books): forward Java book edits to Bedrock

Translate page replacement, insertion, deletion, and signing into Bedrock BookEdit operations. Keep the local book pages current so consecutive Java saves do not insert duplicate pages before the server inventory update arrives.

Open the Java reader when the selected native item is a signed book. Bedrock
opens signed books locally, while Java 26.3 requires OPEN_BOOK from its
server. Live BDS 1.26.51.1 testing confirmed that signing and dropping the
book succeeds but right-clicking never opens the reader. Packet tests
cover selected hotbar slots and verify that reading does not mutate items.
